comments.body:
Style nit, feel free to ignore:

I would like to see something shorter and more concise, like: 

```c++
//! Call a chain notification method on the subscriber.
//!
//! For IPC subscribers: If the call fails because the subscriber returned an
//! error or disconnected, just log a warning. In-process subscribers are not
//! expected to fail.
```
